DESCRIPTION:Sip your way through Oregon’s renowned wine scene in the hea
 rt of Portland. Try a variety of wine varietals\, savor delicious bites\, 
 and discover local wineries\, all while exploring NW Portland’s vibrant 
 Pearl and Slabtown neighborhoods.\n\nPrice: Starting at $129.00
LOCATION:Battle Creek Cellars by Browne Family - Wine Tasting Room\, 820 N
 W 13th Ave\, Portland\, OR 97209
URL:https://lostplate.com/portland-food-tours/
