 w-1080h-1080-1b1363-pillows_jpg.png
DESCRIPTION:Pillows is a gentle\, dreamlike physical-theater performance. 
 Set in the intimate space of a bedroom\, it brings pillows to life — eac
 h with its own voice\, habits\, and temperament. When one pillow turns out
  to be different\, a subtle story unfolds...
LOCATION:The House Studio\, 6677 SW Beaverton Hillsdale Hwy\, Portland\, O
 R 97225
URL:https://fertilegroundpdx.org/
X-SOURCE:Travel Portland
